<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela February inflation falls to 2.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Venezuela February inflation falls to 2.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan consumer prices rose 2.3 percent in February, down from 8.0 percent in February 1996 and 2.6 percent in January, the Venezuelan Central Bank said.</p>
